decision_conditions:
Condition : 1 - The application proposing the Installation of telecommunications equipment cabin and fifteen metre high lattice tower with six dual polar antennae and two dishes is inadequate in respect of the following:-

i) The lack of accurately drawn and scaled drawings of both existing and proposed  plan views of the site and exact location of the structure;

So that the Local Planning Authority is unable to fully assess this development. In the absence of further details, it is considered that the proposals would give rise to a development of unsatisfactory appearance, which in turn, would have a detrimental effect on the residential character and amenity of the locality, as well as being visually intrusive and would also be contrary to Policies Env.1.1 and Env.1.12 of this Council's Unitary Development Plan.
